<title>SWEDEN: Securitas posts 17 pct rise '96 profit.</title>
<headline>Securitas posts 17 pct rise '96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish security company Securitas releases its results for the 12 months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			     550  vs    472</p>
<p> Sales					9,074  vs  7,309</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (SKR)		 2.40  vs   2.00</p>
<p> Operating costs			   7,253 vs  5,828</p>
<p> Gross income				1,821 vs  1,481</p>
<p> Admin costs				 1,136 vs    932</p>
<p> Operating profit after goodwill	 589 vs    483</p>
<p> Net financial items			  39 vs     11</p>
<p> Tax paid					128 vs    105</p>
<p> Deferred tax				   40 vs     20</p>
<p> Minorities					1 vs	1</p>
<p> Net profit				    382 vs    347</p>
<p> Earnings/shr(SKR) after tax	    5.81  vs  5.09</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
